# Non-runtime content excluded to shrink the deploy upload (was 54MB / 1810
# files and hit the 180s upload timeout). LEADING SLASH is required: a bare
# name like `supabase` matches src/lib/supabase too and breaks the build with
# module-not-found. These are anchored to the repo root only.
/artifacts
/docs
/glashdb
/zkteco-bridge
/whatsapp-bridge
/supabase
/skills
/create.md
/supabase-*.sql
/glashdb-*.sql

# Large design source files not referenced by the app (kept in git for
# designers, not needed at runtime).
/public/merch/source
/public/DUNS footer.svg

# home/source is 10MB of design source; keep only the 3 files the site serves.
/public/home/source/*
!/public/home/source/07fbbce755ed61ba1adec6b971cbda1650a2fb94.png
!/public/home/source/0b29fab281d7cfe7e98502c49ddc2794b06f2c3c.png
!/public/home/source/54b250b0180289389a7faef542be363a9bb13baa.png
